--- note on step 1's git status ---
The six lines it prints are `flutter pub get` churn (analysis_options.yaml,
pubspec.lock, four *.xcconfig) plus this evidence directory - they are present
before and after, and are reverted before committing. The point of that step is
what is *absent*: `assets/config/.env` appears nowhere in `git status`, because
`.env` is gitignored, and `pubspec.yaml` is unmodified. There is nothing for a
reviewer or a secret scanner to see.
